EastSun 20260930: "客戶反映 希望可以跟機台一樣 外框不是chrom 不要讓人員可以有額外操作的空間" / "我需要的是 按快捷鍵不會更改到畫面
下面工具列 是軟體的圖標" / "開始" / "左上 軟體關閉的按鈕 我不需要確認都歸零 我只需要讓客戶確認是否真的要關閉軟體".
- tools/hmi_shell/hmi_shell.cpp (+ .rc, manifest, icon, build_hmi_shell.bat -> build_hmi_shell\ht9045_hmi.exe): a Win32
  window hosting the same web HMI in WebView2 (Edge's core, in Windows 11; this machine 154.0.4258.37). Browser shortcuts
  OFF at the engine (AreBrowserAcceleratorKeysEnabled=FALSE: reload, zoom, find, print, back/forward, DevTools keys),
  zoom / pinch / swipe / autofill / status bar off, context menu off in release; its own icon, AppUserModelID
  "HonPrec.HT9045.HMI" and title = document.title (= machine.caption); only 127.0.0.1 / localhost / file:// pages; pop-ups
  blocked in release; one window per session; ✕ / Alt+F4 = one "確定要關閉軟體嗎？" then the main screen's Exit;
  debug: DevTools on Ctrl+Shift+F12. Renderer crash -> reload; browser process crash -> relaunch itself.
  Log %LOCALAPPDATA%\HT9045_HMI_Shell\hmi_shell.log. Own .bat, not CMake: the CMake source list is the laptop's (README).
- tools/hmi_shell/vendor/webview2: Microsoft.Web.WebView2 1.0.4258.31 (NuGet) WebView2.h, WebView2EnvironmentOptions.h,
  x86 WebView2Loader.dll, LICENSE.txt (BSD-style, redistribution allowed with the notice), NOTICE.txt, VERSION.txt (SHA256).
- tools/wb_serve.cpp: HMI-KEEP (W906_HmiLaunch) and MODAL-WAKE start the HMI window first (W906_HMI_SHELL = path, or
  "0"/"off"; else next to wb_serve.exe, else ..\build_hmi_shell), the browser only without it; the normal close and the
  console's immediate close post "HT9045_HMI_SHELL_QUIT" (W906_HmiShellQuit) -- golden's main window is the program.
- tools/open_boot_wait.ps1 (F5's first step): builds the window if missing / older than its source, opens boot_wait.html in it
  with --debug; browser fallback kept.
- FileRW/MainClose.cpp + MachineType.h: golden's "Must finish home process before terminal／請在關閉程式前,執行歸零步驟"
  (sbCloseProgramClick :29062-29068) only with #define W906_EXIT_REQUIRE_HOME (MachineType.h tail, commented = off).
  Kept: running (golden: no reaction), KYEC barcode, IC left in the machine in REAL mode (MES1645 One Cycle), the Q44 stop.
- HMI-SHELL-2 (EastSun after the first run, screenshots): "圖片上的我不需要" (the title bar) -> WS_POPUP window, no caption /
  border / buttons, sized to the monitor's work area (the taskbar stays visible) and re-fitted on WM_DISPLAYCHANGE /
  SPI_SETWORKAREA; Alt+F4 is caught in the page too (AcceleratorKeyPressed) -> the same one question.
  "工具列 我不要顯示HT 我要顯示鴻勁的LOGO" -> hmi_shell.ico = the HonPrec mark (red H bars + blue sphere, no text) cut from
  D:\HT9045\web\assets\img\logo.jpg, transparent background, 16..256 px.
  "紅色正方形 需要連同頁面 也關掉" -> tools/stop_wb_serve.ps1 (the VS Code stop button's postDebugTask) closes the HMI window
  after wb_serve is gone (quit message, then Stop-Process after 5 s) -- also after a forced end; not when it left a
  wb_serve younger than 20 s alone (VS Code's session end at start-up).
Tested offline (static server, no C++): runtime found, page + 1,525 requests loaded, title follows the page, second start ->
front + exit 0, quit message -> closed. wb_serve built in build_integ_ship_x86_o2: EXIT 0. The frameless window compile-checked into a scratch folder (the running copy locks build_hmi_shell\ht9045_hmi.exe; F5 rebuilds it when the window is closed).
Not yet run with wb_serve on the machine.

